WFDB-x for R (package wfdbx)
Copyright (C) 2026 Reza Sameni

The package holds code under two licenses:

* The library (the WFDB library functions, the high-level functions such
  as read_record and write_record, the metadata functions, check_record,
  and the tests) is distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public
  License, version 2.1 or (at your option) any later version: the file
  COPYING.LESSER of the installed package (inst/COPYING.LESSER in the
  sources).

* The command-line tools (R/apps_*.R, R/cli.R with wfdbx_tool and
  wfdbx_tools, and the driver inst/bin/wfdbx.R), translations of the
  tools of the original WFDB Software Package, are distributed under the
  GNU General Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any later
  version: the file COPYING of the installed package (inst/COPYING in the
  sources).

Each source file states its license. The file NOTICE of the installed
package (inst/NOTICE in the sources) summarizes these licenses and gives
the BSD-3-Clause notice of libFLAC, whose stream decoder the FLAC decoder
of WFDB-x (R/flac.R) translates.

WFDB-x is an independent reimplementation of the WFDB Software Package,
version 10.7.0; the original package is Copyright (C) 1983-2022 George B.
Moody and the WFDB contributors.
